# Assessment API contract

## Endpoints

- `POST /assessments` → `201` full flat report JSON
- `GET /assessments/:id` → same full flat report JSON
- `POST /services/emails/assessments/:id` → sends via Nodemailer → `{ "message": "Assessment email sent." }`
- `POST /services/s3/upload` (multipart field `file`, PDF) → `{ id, originalName, mimeType, size }`
- `POST /assessments` may include optional `resumeLink` (Cloudinary URL); backend loads the PDF before the LLM

## Report fields (only these)

`id`, `routeId`, `customerName`, `customerEmail`, `summary`, `headline`, `confidenceScore`, `breakdown`, `strengths`, `improvements`, `priorityImprovements`, `overallRecommendation`

Do not include probability, starRating, status, roadmap, evidence checklist, etc.

## UI breakdown ids

`leadership`, `innovation`, `impact`, `recognition`, `publicProfile`, `recommendationLetters`, `futurePlans` (map research/creativeWork into `innovation`)

Keep shapes aligned with `src/types/assessment.ts`.
